# Private, staged or generated material for this task. None of it is committed:
# hidden cases, seeds and recorded outputs live in each step's tests/private/
# (backed up outside this repository), and the upstream sources, the trimmed docs
# and the crate registry are staged from pinned downloads at packaging time.
tests/private/
steps/*/tests/private/
steps/*/solution/upstream/
steps/*/workdir/docs/
common/staged/
experiment/
